# Trash

::summary
The Trash surface (Settings → Trash, RULED 08-05) in the shell wrapper: circled icon-only back to Settings, the 30-day retention note, and deleted-item rows — kind icon, title, kind + deleted date + days-left meta, trailing Restore and Delete-forever actions (Delete forever is the danger action, always last).
::

